SF2Engine is a Swift port of yishengjiang99/gbk (commit b43f004a7e95321d2decde2e604350b014dcd105:
sf2-parser.ts, src/sf2-renderer.ts) by the same author. It was extracted from
omr-sheet-cam Packages/SF2Player.

Not in git: the GeneralUser GS SoundFont 2.0.2 (GeneralUser-GS.sf2) used by the tests is by
S. Christian Collins (https://github.com/mrbumpy409/GeneralUser-GS), GeneralUser GS License v2.0.
scripts/fetch-soundfont downloads it from the pin in soundfont.lock.
